### Spring Boot environment-specific profiles ###
# Local/dev config may hold machine-specific values; keep it out of git.
# Commit a application-<profile>.example.yml template instead.
**/application-local.yml
**/application-local.yaml
**/application-local.properties
**/application-dev.yml
**/application-dev.yaml
**/application-dev.properties
!**/application-*.example.*
